    "terms.items.t6": "Moderation, Reports, and Sanctions",
    "terms.items.p6":
      "You can use the “Report” button to report content or users, and block them from the app. You can also write to contact@prometheustij.com. We will review reports as soon as possible. We may remove content, limit features, suspend or cancel accounts, and cooperate with authorities when appropriate. We maintain a zero-tolerance policy toward objectionable content and abusive conduct. We may review reported content, including direct messages, to investigate and take action. Decisions may be appealed by writing to the same email. We are not obligated to monitor all conversations, but we may do so.",
    "terms.items.t7": "Community Alerts and No Guarantee",
